silm:instances_papers_18_presheaf_semantics_02_mittens_anchor_concrete_anchor_5_Felis_catus silm:hasExample "In 'P1802_mittens_anchorConcreteAnchor5', the bare-symbol→anchor table grounds the abstract symbols in the Tartu-Animal-Clinic / Mittens-2026-05-18 domain story. For example, the Felis catus / TSN 183798 taxonomy source leg of D_Mittens that refines the cat classification without replacing the apex." .
